{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And were shut.</b> Like ויסגרו, and the kaf does not interchange with gimel; rather they are two roots and the meaning is one, for they do not interchange, except for the letters yod, heh, vav, alef, and samekh with shin." "<b>And the rain was restrained.</b> It was shut up in the storehouse."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Reading כלות as a spelling variant of כתרים/שרשים (roots); the word is textually uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:42.453572638Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}